1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:08,190
Here is the article by the Japanese student about his personal experience.

2
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:10,865
Read the article.

3
00:00:10,865 --> 00:00:13,780
A tidal wave.

4
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:18,100
I went to the beach with my friends last Saturday.

5
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:24,530
When we were playing on the beach, suddenly the water started to go away.

6
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:27,160
We heard people shouting.

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:30,660
They were telling us to run away from the beach.

8
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:33,980
A big wave was coming towards us.

9
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:37,670
We ran up the hill as fast as possible.

10
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:44,090
When I looked back, the whole beach and all the buildings below us were in water.

11
00:00:44,090 --> 00:00:46,530
Many boats were damaged.

12
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:53,110
After the tidal wave passed, the police checked to see if everyone was okay.

13
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:57,440
They warned us to stay away from the beach for a few days.

14
00:00:57,440 --> 00:01:06,520
They told us that there was an earthquake a few kilometers away under the sea, and it caused the tidal wave.

15
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:10,440
Luckily, no one was hurt or killed.

16
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:13,690
All of us were happy that we were safe.
